 146:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_usart_ex.c ****      (+) HAL_USARTEx_EnableSPISlaveMode() API enables the SPI slave mode
 147:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_usart_ex.c ****      (+) HAL_USARTEx_DisableSPISlaveMode() API disables the SPI slave mode
 148:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_usart_ex.c ****      (+) HAL_USARTEx_ConfigNSS API configures the Slave Select input pin (NSS)
