 150:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_usart_ex.c ****      (+) HAL_USARTEx_DisableFifoMode() API disables the FIFO mode
 151:stm/stm32g4xx/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_usart_ex.c ****      (+) HAL_USARTEx_SetTxFifoThreshold() API sets the TX FIFO threshold
